        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A 0.70-acre rural site with full residential planning permission. Planning permission (Donegal County Council Reference 2150112) is granted until 20th April 2031 for the construction of an architect-designed one-off house. One-and-a-half storey style, the house has a total floor area of almost 2,400 square feet. The site adjoins a minor public road and is conveniently located almost equidistant from the towns of Lifford, Raphoe and St. Johnston. The footprint of the house area has already been cleared with a hardcore-surfaced entrance installed. Full plans and details available on enquiry. All enquiries welcome."
